     <svg:title>text</svg:title>
     <text:p text:style-name="P7"><text:span text:style-name="T2">Therefore \/d50; and \/d1000; in the example shall set the delay to be equal to 50 and 1000 milliseconds accordingly.</text:span></text:p>
